# PROJECT: BUILD A PREMIUM ELECTRONICS E-COMMERCE WEBSITE

Act as a senior full-stack developer, UI/UX designer, e-commerce architect, and conversion rate optimization expert.

Build a complete, modern, responsive, premium electronics e-commerce website with a professional design, smooth animations, interactive components, and functional shopping features.

The website should look like a premium technology retail brand, combining the usability of Amazon, the clean design of Apple, and the product discovery experience of Best Buy.

Do not create just a static landing page. Build a complete multi-page e-commerce application with reusable components, functional interactions, proper routing, and a scalable architecture.

